                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="VFJaxEmsMhs_FVUVy03t-90" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Modification documents are linked to the MSN therefore, will be traceable with the new registration&lt;b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;/b&gt;Parts in the configuration control module will remain linked to the aircraft even after registration change&lt;b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;1-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;A/C Owner to be defined adequately for rotable ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;- The Maintenance Program shall applicable to the new operator as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;3-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;C&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;autious with the history data updates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; It is strongly recommended to perform this action when there is minimum activity on the system.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;dashed=1;" parent="VFJaxEmsMhs_FVUVy03t-10" vertex="1">
